    title: "Personal Injury Leads for Lawyers: Handling Them Once They Arrive",
    metaTitle: "Handling Personal Injury Leads for Lawyers",
    excerpt: "A practical guide to handling personal injury leads effectively once they've already been delivered.",
    metaDescription: "Once a personal injury lead arrives, response speed and intake quality determine whether it converts. A practical guide to handling leads after delivery.",
    category: "Personal Injury",
    readTime: "7 min read",
    publishedDate: "2026-10-27",
